{
  "title": "Handwritten declaration: format and how to write it",
  "seoTitle": "Handwritten declaration format: how to write it | SahiSize",
  "description": "The exact IBPS and SBI handwritten declaration text, how to write and scan it, and the 800×400 px, 50–100 KB size the portal checks.",
  "lang": "en",
