    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Common mistakes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "ALL CAPITALS.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " The single most common rejection. Write normally."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Typed or printed text.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " It must be your handwriting."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Hindi text.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " Banking notices ask for English."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Lined paper.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " The lines show in the scan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Tiny writing in a corner.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " Crop close and write big."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "File too small.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " A clean scan can come out under 50 KB. SahiSize raises quality to reach the minimum."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Old declaration from another exam.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " Check the text each time."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "FAQ"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Can I write the declaration in Hindi?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Banking notices ask for English. If your notice allows another language, it will say so clearly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Should I write the date and place under the declaration?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Not unless your notice asks for it. Write exactly the prescribed text."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "What if my handwriting is not neat?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Neatness is not judged; readability is. Write slowly and bigger than usual, and keep it in running handwriting."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The portal says “declaration not clear”. What do I do?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Rewrite with a darker pen, photograph in better light, and crop closer. Zoom into the result before uploading."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Is SahiSize linked to IBPS or SBI?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "No. SahiSize is an independent tool. Always check the latest official notice. Also see "
        },
